      <h1 class="article__title" data-pagefind-meta="title">GTA 6 Jason and Lucia: Who They Are (No Spoilers)</h1>
      <p class="article__meta">
        <span class="article__updated">Last updated <time datetime="2026-11-18" data-pagefind-meta="updated[datetime]">18 Nov 2026</time></span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span class="article__published">Published <time datetime="2026-11-18">18 Nov 2026</time></span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span>2 min read</span>
      </p>
      <p class="article__byline">By <span class="article__author">Leonida Guides Team</span> <span class="article__ai">· Written with AI help and fact-checked against the cited sources.</span> <a class="article__ai-link" href="/about/">How we work</a></p><p class="article__lead">Two leads, one risky plan. See how Jason and Lucia play, how you switch between them, and what Rockstar shows, with all story details hidden.</p>
